step Journeyman Herbalism
  tip Journeyman Herbalism raises Herbalism's cap to 150, needs Herbalism 50 and costs 5s (the arrow picks the nearest Herbalism trainer of your faction).
  train Herbalism Journeyman

step Pick Silverleaf and Peacebloom (Herbalism 70-89)
  tip 87 Silverleaf and 87 Peacebloom for Alchemy 1-75: 87 Elixirs of Minor Defense. Pick 87 Silverleaf and 87 Peacebloom (Herbalism 70 to 89), then craft 82 Elixirs of Minor Defense (Alchemy 1 to 75). The window lists the Herbalism areas for your level, best first: the arrow leads to the one you pick and rests there until your bags hold them.
  collect 765 x87 gather Herbalism 50
