  collect 2449 x46 anywhere gather Herbalism 1

step Elixir of Minor Fortitude to 92
  tip Elixir of Minor Fortitude is orange at 75 (yellow 80, green 100, grey 120): about 20 crafts to 92, up to 23 for 9 players in 10 (the gathered materials above count that many). Each takes 2 Earthroot, 1 Peacebloom and 1 Empty Vial. Two Earthroot and a Peacebloom a craft, herbs of the starting zones and the 10-20 zones; orange to 80.
  craft 2334 until 92

step Herbalism 100-115: Stranglekelp & Bruiseweed
  tip Pick from Herbalism 100 to 115 for Elixir of Wisdom: this area gives Mageroyal and Briarthorn, and the next one the rest from Herbalism 115. The window lists the areas for your level, best first: the arrow leads to the one you pick and rests once you are in it; each keeps to creatures no more than a level above you and away from the other faction's towns.
