  tip Back to an Alchemy trainer: Elixir of Wisdom (from 90). Train Expert Herbalism on this visit too: it raises Herbalism's cap to 225, needs Herbalism 125 and costs 50s (the arrow picks the nearest Herbalism trainer of your faction).
