  collect 3820 x42 anywhere gather Herbalism 170

step Alchemy recipes at 160
  tip Back to the Expert trainer: Mana Potion (from 160).
  learn 3452 npc 4160 only Alliance
  learn 3452 npc 4611 only Horde

step Mana Potion to 195
  tip Mana Potion is orange at 160 (yellow 180, green 200, grey 220): about 39 crafts to 195, up to 42 for 9 players in 10 (the gathered materials above count that many). Each takes 1 Stranglekelp, 1 Kingsblood and 1 Leaded Vial. Stranglekelp grows under water along the coasts: bring a water breathing elixir or come up for air. Kingsblood grows in the 20-40 zones.
  craft 3452 until 195

step Herbalism 175-185: Liferoot & Goldthorn
  tip Pick from Herbalism 175 to 185 for Elixir of Defense: this area gives Goldthorn, and the next one the rest from Herbalism 185. The window lists the areas for your level, best first: the arrow leads to the one you pick and rests once you are in it; each keeps to creatures no more than a level above you and away from the other faction's towns.
