  collect 3355 x34 anywhere gather Herbalism 200

step Alchemy recipes at 195
  tip Back to the Expert trainer: Elixir of Defense (from 195). Train Artisan Herbalism on this visit too: it raises Herbalism's cap to 300, needs Herbalism 200 and costs 5g (the arrow picks the nearest Herbalism trainer of your faction).
  learn 11450 npc 4160 only Alliance
  learn 11450 npc 4611 only Horde
  train Herbalism Artisan

step Elixir of Defense to 225
  tip Elixir of Defense is orange at 195 (yellow 215, green 235, grey 255): about 32 crafts to 225, up to 34 for 9 players in 10 (the gathered materials above count that many). Each takes 1 Wild Steelbloom, 1 Goldthorn and 1 Leaded Vial. Wild Steelbloom and Goldthorn are the herbs of the 30-45 zones (Stranglethorn, Arathi, the Badlands). Alchemy 225 is a Legacy System milestone.
  craft 11450 until 225
  skill Alchemy 225

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Artisan (225-300)
section Alchemy 225-300

step Alchemy 225-300: vendor goods
  tip Buy the whole bracket's share in one go: 51 Leaded Vial (20s 40c) and 86 Crystal Vial (4g 30s); about 4g 50s 40c in all. The arrow picks the nearest seller of your faction (Stormwind City: Edna Mullby, Eldraeith and Jasper Fel; Orgrimmar: Felika, Kor'geld and Rekkul).
  buy 3372 x51 nearest
  buy 8925 x86 nearest

step Recipe: Elixir of Superior Defense
  tip Recipe: Elixir of Superior Defense teaches Elixir of Greater Defense (Alchemy 265) for 1g 30s. Sold by Alliance: Soolie Berryfizz (Ironforge), limited stock; Horde: Kor'geld (Orgrimmar), limited stock. Its sellers keep one or two in stock that come back some time after a sale; the Auction House often has it too.
  buy 13478 nearest

step Get Stonescale Eel
  zone Stranglethorn Vale
  tip 48 Stonescale Eel for Alchemy 225-300: 48 Elixirs of Greater Defense. Fish them from the Stonescale Eel Swarm pools at the marked spot. Or buy them at the Auction House.
  collect 13422 x48 @27.5,76.5 era gather Fishing 225
  auction 13422 x48

step Artisan Alchemy
  zone Azeroth
  tip Artisan raises the cap from 225 to 300 for 4g 50s (Classic's price; Forever's is not in the data); it needs Alchemy 200 and character level 35, so you can take it on any visit from 200. Only a few trainers teach it: Alliance Kylanna Windwhisper (Feralas) and Master Mycologist Shurome (Felwood); Horde Master Mycologist Shurome (Felwood) and Rogvar (Swamp of Sorrows). This route trains it at Kylanna Windwhisper (Feralas) for the Alliance and Rogvar (Swamp of Sorrows) for the Horde, who also teach the recipes of 225-300: one trainer for every visit. 225-300 takes about 1g 30s of recipes and 4g 50s 40c of vendor goods, plus 144 Purple Lotus, 48 Sungrass and 48 Stonescale Eel to gather or buy. The gathering steps below come between the visits: learn each recipe when you are back for it.
  level 35
  train Alchemy Artisan npc 7948 only Alliance
  train Alchemy Artisan npc 1386 only Horde

step Pick Wild Steelbloom and Goldthorn (Herbalism 210-226)
  tip 11 Wild Steelbloom and 11 Goldthorn for Alchemy 225-230: 11 Elixirs of Defense; from your herbalism on the way: 11 of 11 Wild Steelbloom. Pick 11 Goldthorn (Herbalism 210 to 226), then craft 8 Elixirs of Defense (Alchemy 225 to 230). The window lists the Herbalism areas for your level, best first: the arrow leads to the one you pick and rests there until your bags hold them.
  collect 3821 x11 gather Herbalism 210
