step Elixir of Defense to 230
  tip Elixir of Defense is yellow at 225 (yellow 215, green 235, grey 255): about 8 crafts to 230, up to 11 for 9 players in 10 (the gathered materials above count that many). Each takes 1 Wild Steelbloom, 1 Goldthorn and 1 Leaded Vial. Wild Steelbloom and Goldthorn are the herbs of the 30-45 zones (Stranglethorn, Arathi, the Badlands). If you got here without learning Elixir of Defense, learn it now: an earlier step teaches it.
  learn 11450 npc 4160 only Alliance
  learn 11450 npc 4611 only Horde
  craft 11450 until 230

