step Elixir of Greater Defense to 300
  tip Elixir of Greater Defense is orange at 265 (yellow 280, green 300, grey 320): about 43 crafts to 300, up to 48 for 9 players in 10 (the gathered materials above count that many). Each takes 2 Stonescale Oil, 1 Sungrass and 1 Crystal Vial. Make the 86 Stonescale Oil (43 crafts) first. Stonescale Eel comes from the Stonescale Eel schools on the coasts of the 40-55 zones, or the Auction House (fishers sell them in stacks). Sungrass grows in the 40-55 zones. Alchemy 300 is a Legacy System milestone.
